// Deterministic, reviewed locale strings — NEVER generated by Workers AI
// at render time. Two kinds of fixed content live here:
//
//   1. Localized labels for the application's internal status codes
//      (STATUS_OPTIONS below never changes independently of this file —
//      see worker/src/routes/staff.js, which imports STATUS_OPTIONS from
//      here so the two can never drift apart).
//   2. The payment-discrepancy safety warning shown beneath a bilingual
//      payment description (Phase 3.1 Section 18).
//
// Both are looked up by the client's own preferred_communication_language,
// never translated per-request — this is fixed UI/safety copy, not
// dynamic staff-authored prose (see Phase 3.1 Section 21).

